Z||000000||Leadfoot||09-12-2001||12:14 AM||||Do the v6 fieros have one?  The reason I as is that I was coming home from a birthday party (wasn't fun at all, we watched the news and were just amazed at the devistation a few idiots in the world can do) and a v6 camero with a borla exhaust tried to race me (he must have needed to release some tension).  An older grand am tried to get in on the action and I walked away from both of them....anyway my engine just cut out for a split second while I shifted to 3rd at high r's.  I thought it I hit the rev limit but I am not sure if the fieros are equipped with one.  Anyone know for certain? ||||reg||5
